      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "Zoom gestures can be taken over without breaking accessibility",
        "statement": "Ctrl or Cmd with the wheel, trackpad pinch and the keyboard zoom keys can be intercepted and turned into camera zoom, and the result still works for people who rely on zoom to read. Zoom chosen from the browser menu cannot be intercepted, so it must be detected and handled gracefully.",
