      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "Give the wheel to the surface, then to the camera",
        "action": "A plain wheel scrolls the nearest surface that can move the way the wheel goes, including the outer page when an inner box is at its end, and otherwise zooms the camera. Then latch the gesture to the surface it started on until it pauses, so momentum does not carry it across to the camera.",
